    "Shoo checks the pages you open in Firefox. This is what leaves your phone." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shoo checks the pages you open in Firefox. This is what leaves your phone."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shoo memeriksa halaman yang kamu buka di Firefox. Ini yang keluar dari ponselmu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without it, Shoo checks pages on your phone only and protects you less. Risky pages are still reported. You can change this in Profile." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Without it, Shoo checks pages on your phone only and protects you less. Risky pages are still reported. You can change this in Profile."
